   "id": 366963,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<p>Use properties of  real numbers and mental math to calculate the following:</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"9 \\times 8 \\times 11\">9 \\times 8 \\times 11</span></p>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"9 \\times 11 = 99\\,\">9 \\times 11 = 99\\</span>. Using that, the problem can be changed to <span data-math=\"99 \\times 8\">99 \\times 8</span>. Change to <span data-math=\"99 = (100 - 1)\">99 = (100 - 1)</span>. Using the distributive property, <span data-math=\"99 \\times 8 = (100 - 1) \\times 8 = 100 \\times 8 - 1 \\times 8 = 800 - 8 = 792\">99 \\times 8 = (100 - 1) \\times 8 = 100 \\times 8 - 1 \\times 8 = 800 - 8 = 792</span>."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
